   "id": "S12_interrogative_ma",
   "rule": "Preposition + mā with the alif dropped (fīma, mimma, ʿamma, lima, bima) → stress the preposition. With the alif written (fīmā, mimmā, ʿammā, limā, bimā) → stress the mīm (mimmā: 1st and 3rd mīm; ʿammā: ʿayn and 2nd mīm; fīmā: fāʾ).",
   "examples": [
    "4:97 فِيمَ",
    "86:5 مِمَّ",
    "78:1 عَمَّ",
    "61:2 لِمَ",
    "15:54 فَبِمَ"
   ]
  },
